        "id": 12867,
        "quiz_id": 2166,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Some people believe that good health is a basic human need, so medical services should not be run by for-profit companies.  Do the advantages of private healthcare centers outweigh their disadvantages? ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VURqdyBy7ot355xal5ollOESgEf\"><em><strong>Some people believe that good health is a basic human need, so medical services should not be run by for-profit companies. </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DMT8dOBumo0vExxERHxlBBtbgSb\"><em><strong>Do the advantages of private healthcare centers outweigh their disadvantages?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Private Healthcare</em></p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gjvqdp17pojZqBxz5TklXFMmgbh\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Private Healthcare&nbsp;đưa ra một &yacute; kiến l&agrave; \"Sức khỏe l&agrave; nhu cầu cơ bản của con người, n&ecirc;n c&aacute;c dịch vụ y tế kh&ocirc;ng n&ecirc;n được điều h&agrave;nh bởi c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty v&igrave; lợi nhuận\", v&agrave; đề b&agrave;i hỏi liệu lợi &iacute;ch của c&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m y tế tư nh&acirc;n c&oacute; lớn hơn nhược điểm của ch&uacute;ng hay kh&ocirc;ng.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CInVdPgJYo43zQxEBdQlh7nCgte\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một chủ đề g&acirc;y tranh c&atilde;i. Một số người cho rằng y tế l&agrave; dịch vụ c&ocirc;ng, kh&ocirc;ng n&ecirc;n để tư nh&acirc;n tham gia v&igrave; họ chỉ quan t&acirc;m đến lợi nhuận. Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, nhiều quốc gia vẫn cho ph&eacute;p c&aacute;c bệnh viện tư nh&acirc;n hoạt động song song với hệ thống y tế c&ocirc;ng, v&igrave; họ c&oacute; thể gi&uacute;p giảm tải v&agrave; n&acirc;ng cao chất lượng dịch vụ.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KgGvdgcCRoty3TxID2tlQsUpgVu\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaaPdALkUoj39UxqBaClSdzHg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nq58dEv0aoLfQfxnVxzljGZSgrb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YEFidEyZZooDJIxqxOil7eLBgQh\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n c&oacute; thể cho rằng lợi &iacute;ch lớn hơn hoặc nhỏ hơn nhược điểm đều được.</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong>Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lập luận theo c&aacute;ch Antithesis (phản đề).</strong></li>\n<li>Ở đ&acirc;y, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm 'lợi &iacute;ch lớn hơn nhược điểm'.</li>\n<li>Để bảo vệ quan điểm n&agrave;y, m&igrave;nh sẽ lập luận bằng c&aacute;ch si&ecirc;u đơn giản nhất c&oacute; thể. M&igrave;nh nghĩ c&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m y tế tư nh&acirc;n đ&oacute;ng vai tr&ograve; quan trọng trong việc đảm bảo sức khỏe cho người d&acirc;n (vế n&agrave;y m&igrave;nh sẽ viết ở BODY 2).</li>\n<li>Vậy th&igrave; BODY 1 m&igrave;nh viết c&aacute;i g&igrave; đ&acirc;y? M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về nhược điểm của y tế tư nh&acirc;n, tuy nhi&ecirc;n, m&igrave;nh n&oacute;i những nhược điểm n&agrave;y c&oacute; thể được khắc phục, v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng đ&aacute;ng kể bằng lợi &iacute;ch m&agrave; y tế tư nh&acirc;n mang lại.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GgAMd32deowSSXxbidHlnh8kgrh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Q8dKUwJolsRLxRHMKlYAGzgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 1</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARYZdTorMo8GHUxXiaxlbgKog9K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3WzdXi90obr9exqY49ldT5Wg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3vid37FgouPrLxntpAllbSOgpd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABpydqwzqoBt8mxtA2clX4h8gmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRtld534aoXQ8Cxcdevl45SsgZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtESdRTjnoSJwzxYBWkl2MvDgXb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaoQdMKTxottsFx5xHZl5y6dgTe\">M&igrave;nh b&agrave;n về một số nhược điểm của c&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m y tế tư nh&acirc;n (<strong>private healthcare centers</strong>) tuy nhi&ecirc;n c&oacute; thể khắc phục được.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Js85dg1O0onnMSxyMnHl9MMcgld\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J2Mgd651jokGr5xFFcTlMHOagYg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YIkYdyyfZoikZgxMfM9ly4SYghh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk2zdFhmloeQGbxZgDwlEsvwgnh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JesqdVbvXoysYjxqtf7lyoDSg7c\">Việc khu vực tư nh&acirc;n cung cấp dịch vụ y tế (<strong>private sector's provision of healthcare</strong>) c&oacute; thể dẫn đến một số vấn đề kh&ocirc;ng mong muốn.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSGudTTeHoUUbwxmgwvlnevNg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br0HdPtt2o6yaDxssU5lFwBbgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXHedb5Q5o0ChTxzjeJlACIHgBe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw7XdcQDiopHAmxbaJzlaWDZgjb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EAA1dQKV5otLAmxFGgBlpln2gIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5dHdBAjeojWA3xMEbCl8pn1gyB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">Để tối đa h&oacute;a lợi nhuận (<strong>maximizing earnings</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ c&oacute; thể k&ecirc; đơn thuốc kh&ocirc;ng cần thiết (<strong>prescription of unnecessary medicines</strong>) v&agrave; x&eacute;t nghiệm kh&ocirc;ng cần thiết (<strong>redundant examinations</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ l&atilde;ng ph&iacute; thời gian v&agrave; tiền bạc của bệnh nh&acirc;n</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ đẩy chi ph&iacute; y tế l&ecirc;n cao (<strong>drive up medical expense</strong>)&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">&nbsp; ➜ người ngh&egrave;o (<strong>the underprivileged</strong>) kh&oacute; tiếp cận dịch vụ y tế chất lượng cao&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">&nbsp;Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJW5dfJhqofjuXxEd7dlCvwzg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQSEdv0Y1oIVaoxMMoxljdOvgOd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNQNdCbCpoystuxVP43luHtDgeb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ7FdScShoqf2QxHEgylSbaAgyf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFfDdmOXNoOWwZxiNtZl15SMgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zKdQFrWoIXtex6mhplQSoegxb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, việc k&ecirc; đơn bừa b&atilde;i (<strong>indiscriminate prescriptions</strong>) c&oacute; thể được hạn chế</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">&nbsp; ➜ ch&iacute;nh phủ c&oacute; thể tiến h&agrave;nh thanh tra thường xuy&ecirc;n (<strong>regular inspections</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">&nbsp; ➜ đảm bảo l&agrave; c&aacute;c cơ sở y tế tư tu&acirc;n thủ (<strong>ensure compliance with</strong>)<strong> </strong>c&aacute;c ti&ecirc;u chuẩn h&agrave;nh nghề kh&aacute;m chữa bệnh (<strong>standard medical practices</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">&nbsp; ➜ khu vực y tế c&ocirc;ng (<strong>public healthcare sector</strong>) thường c&oacute; gi&aacute; rẻ hơn v&agrave; cung cấp bảo hiểm y tế gi&aacute; cả phải chăng (<strong>affordable health insurance</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">&nbsp; ➜ giảm bất b&igrave;nh đẳng (<strong>alleviating inequalities</strong>)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jo9cdHYcooaKCQxdDaTlbws2gHh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 2</strong> </span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkKtdjQLbo1AtlxkzyalC6VXgEc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZT8dluWuoiebixsy4zlDBdDg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub8odKVWsohu3TxKHTylRfJ3gqT\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IO0OdZMbkop2KtxaAgbl07P0g3f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ap4ndJ97bocXozxn7oAl3Txmgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwiNdcUNSoCW0UxEnPxlYn1NgYe\">M&igrave;nh b&agrave;n về lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể của c&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m y tế tư nh&acirc;n.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YoSudcjoDop5Czx2TyIlLxgpgfd\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">&nbsp;Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZakddQ7nJoAgFyxpFvNleucyg4d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBDmdoEGDoDyBgxNOqylocGigdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoBydy7ixoRrKIxO5gdlnQbzg7e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FPwwd6a20oL0khxlV17lQP1fgSh\">Bảo vệ sức khỏe cộng đồng vẫn l&agrave; ưu ti&ecirc;n h&agrave;ng đầu (<strong>top priority</strong>) của c&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m y tế tư nh&acirc;n.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOMmd2z40oU1GpxeAiOljjORg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IP8udCf4UodaQ1xp6r1lvwiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FWGcdCLrAodR0zx9hxultvvcg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JcusdZSFzovztExclQWl7chLg4e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9rFdK1ipoSiH8x8Lc1lqPoUgYf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZa1dU6WtoYm51x9m3JlC8V6gQe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">Ở nhiều quốc gia, hệ thống y tế c&ocirc;ng (<strong>state-run system</strong>) kh&ocirc;ng đủ đ&aacute;p ứng nhu cầu của người d&acirc;n (<strong>meeting public demand</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">&nbsp; ➜ cần sự tham gia của y tế tư nh&acirc;n (<strong>private</strong> <strong>sector</strong>)&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">&nbsp; ➜ nếu kh&ocirc;ng, những người bệnh nặng phải chờ đợi rất l&acirc;u để được phục vụ (<strong>receive services</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">&nbsp; ➜ v&iacute; dụ như ở Anh hoặc Canada.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZnEdzqc4oEV4wxO5mZluCDFgQd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXimdSddLo8wilxpbXMli5xmgBf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXfQd5foZotNYvxR3yulUfOegnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JKs3d2HFfoJfLcxOlhZlsYPPgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVGzda09ioegiAxjp4BlwN6Ugee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc96dxi8Do6jiRxbpzIlbykXgw1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c bệnh viện tư nh&acirc;n lu&ocirc;n chịu &aacute;p lực phải cải thiện dịch vụ (<strong>develop their services</strong>) để thu h&uacute;t kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ thường xuy&ecirc;n n&acirc;ng cấp cơ sở vật chất (<strong>facilities</strong>) v&agrave; chất lượng đội ngũ y tế (<strong>medical staff</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ mang lại lợi &iacute;ch cho bệnh nh&acirc;n v&agrave; th&uacute;c đẩy y tế c&ocirc;ng l&agrave;m theo (<strong>encourages the public sector to follow suit</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 73,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SWftdgvNhoCtDKxbs4wlDGBagnh\">Opinions are divided on whether profit-driven<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </span>organizations<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"> </span>should be involved in providing healthcare services. <strong>I believe their participation, despite certain unavoidable shortcomings, offers far more benefits than drawbacks to medical systems overall.</strong></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12867,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 74,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lajrdmm6HoTfboxB07ilXxuMge4\"><strong>On the one hand, the private sector&rsquo;s provision of healthcare entails certain undesirable problems.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">In pursuit of maximizing earnings, there may be the prescription of unnecessary medicines and redundant examinations. This not only wastes patients&rsquo; time and money, but it can also drive up medical expenses for everyone, potentially barring access by the underprivileged to high quality care.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">However, indiscriminate prescriptions could be effectively limited by regular inspections by the authorities to ensure compliance with standard medical practices by private institutions. Moreover, the public healthcare sector, which typically charges much lower prices and offers affordable health insurance, can also play a substantial in alleviating such inequalities.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12867,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 75,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MIlhdgAT3omGYjxPzZ5lr2ZKgrQ\"><strong>On the other hand, protecting the public&rsquo;s health remains a top priority for private healthcare centers.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">In several countries, the state-run system is inadequate in meeting public demand, necessitating the participation of the private sector. Otherwise, in their absence, even citizens with serious illnesses would have to wait for far too long to receive services, as can be seen in the UK or Canada.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Furthermore, under constant pressure to develop their services to attract more customers, private hospitals tend to upgrade their facilities and the quality of their medical staff on a regular basis. Striving for improvement both benefits their patients and also encourages the public sector to follow suit.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12867,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 76,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ao1mdwbccoBREyxikDkluJhZgth\">In conclusion, there are valid concerns that the financial incentives of private healthcare institutions come at the expense of their patients, but this can be mitigated by government regulation. I believe the private medical sector does play a crucial role in ensuring the ongoing well-being of the people.</div>\n</div>",
